1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,734
AEGIS audits network devices from any vendor.

2
00:00:03,734 --> 00:00:07,183
The AI suggests, humans decide, and rules judge.

3
00:00:08,196 --> 00:00:14,925
Three devices are already analyzed: pfSense, SONiC, and an Arista router AEGIS has never seen.

4
00:00:14,912 --> 00:00:16,305
Now a Cisco router.

5
00:00:16,305 --> 00:00:20,190
One unified parser handles any vendor and any format.

6
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:24,865
Secrets are redacted and injection text is quarantined first.

7
00:00:24,865 --> 00:00:29,899
Known lines match instantly, the rest go to the AI in parallel batches.

8
00:00:29,899 --> 00:00:31,388
Seconds, not minutes.

9
00:00:31,491 --> 00:00:36,230
Six secrets were hidden before any AI saw the file, and they are never stored.

10
00:00:36,544 --> 00:00:39,413
Everything maps onto one vendor-neutral model.

11
00:00:39,726 --> 00:00:43,378
Verdicts come only from thirty-nine cited rules.

12
00:00:43,378 --> 00:00:44,975
The AI plays no part.

13
00:00:45,279 --> 00:00:47,732
Each finding shows how it was decided.

14
00:00:47,732 --> 00:00:52,122
A setting the config never mentions is unknown, never a silent pass.

15
00:00:52,472 --> 00:00:54,634
Unsure lines go to a human.

16
00:00:54,634 --> 00:00:57,436
Here is an undocumented policy tag.

17
00:00:57,786 --> 00:01:01,730
The reviewer maps it once: logging enabled, with a note.

18
00:01:03,702 --> 00:01:07,825
After an explicit check, it becomes a permanent pattern.

19
00:01:07,825 --> 00:01:08,856
No retraining.

20
00:01:09,206 --> 00:01:12,080
Now a misconfigured router with the same line.

21
00:01:14,582 --> 00:01:18,166
One interface description tells the AI to answer pass.

22
00:01:19,291 --> 00:01:22,350
The sanity gate blocks it before any AI call.

23
00:01:26,662 --> 00:01:30,800
The taught line is now recognized instantly, so logging passes.

24
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,807
And the access list permits everything before denying telnet.

25
00:01:34,807 --> 00:01:37,500
AEGIS flags that dead rule, with the fix.

26
00:01:37,633 --> 00:01:40,222
Every device gets a PDF report.

27
00:01:40,449 --> 00:01:43,313
Insights show how every finding was decided.

28
00:01:43,513 --> 00:01:45,449
AEGIS supports the auditor.

29
00:01:45,449 --> 00:01:47,457
It never takes the decision.

